// Orbit definitions for the hero animation.
// Each entry describes one periodic n-body solution: an SVG path (traced by the
// bodies), plus keyTimes/keyPoints so motion speed matches the real physics
// (equal time-steps mapped to the true, unequal arc-length covered per step).
//
// bodies[].begin staggers each dot's start along the SAME shared path/keyTimes/
// keyPoints (works for "choreography" solutions where every body traces one
// identical curve, like the figure-eight). If a future orbit's bodies DON'T
// share one curve, give that body its own `path` / `keyTimes` / `keyPoints`
// and script.js will use those instead of the orbit-level shared ones.
//
// To add another solution: verify real initial conditions first (see chat
// history for the process used on the figure-eight), integrate it the same
// way, and push a new entry here. script.js picks one at random on page load.

